            "review_title": "Review at Cafe 343",
            "review_text": "Brent V\nEdmonton, Canada43 contributions\n0\nNice place to relax.\nApr 2024 • Solo\nThis is a nice cafe, lots of greenery and open air. The water fountain and waterfalls were relaxing. Compared to other restaurants, the menu is reasonably priced with most items under 130K Dong. The only negative I have is the service is very slow, expect a hour or more for your choice of dinner to arrive. The food is tasty for a cafe but average for a good restaurant. Al in all the atmosphere carries this cafe, definitely worth visiting👍.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 28, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
