            "review_title": "Review at Cafe 343",
            "review_text": "Tony D\n9 contributions\n0\nExcellant food and service\nJun 2018 • Couples\nI've been here 2 times now and have never been disappointed. The location is within walking distance of Bui Vien ( about 15 minutes) or a 30-40,000 VND taxi ride. The staff are very good as is the food. I was the only westerner both times which I found strange because its layout is perfect. You can sit outside under the shade and there are various non smoking lounges inside. Highly recommended.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 12, 2018",
