            "review_text": "Minh-Anh Quach\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam166 contributions\n0\nLocal middle class coffee/food\nJun 2018 • Family\nGood place to get a hint of the local lifestyle. Decent food, though street food will always be better for specific dishes. We didn’t try the coffee, though. Music was some sh*tty club music when we arrived and then changed to something more relaxing after a while.\nWritten June 4, 2018",
